# Conformance probe pack whose own counted list has the name of the inner
# pack's counted list (spec 0.34, ruling 7 and Decode step 4), most
# significant bit first. Public. No kinds.
#
#   nums        an 8-bit count, then that many items, val in 8 bits each
#   the rest    one conformance-inner-countonly message (its nums are
#               discarded on decode, but its count is checked against the
#               item budget the outer list left)
format     conformance-inner-countlists
version    0.34.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
group   probe.nums count 8
  field  probe.val  8  uint
end
inner   conformance-inner-countonly
